docs {
  # Delete Shop

  Delete a shop from the system.

  **Warning:** This action cannot be undone.

  Replace `SHOP-999` with the shop name you want to delete.

  ## Example Response (Success)

  ```json
  {
    "message": "ok"
  }
  ```

  ## Error Response (Shop Not Found)

  ```json
  {
    "exception": "frappe.exceptions.DoesNotExistError",
    "_server_messages": "Shop SHOP-999 not found"
  }
  ```
}
